<description>&lt;p&gt;Recent bomb blasts in Satun injured three students and prompted police to step up border security in multiple provinces, while Perlis authorities tightened vigilance after the attacks. Thai forces scrambled F-16s to the Tak border as clashes in Myanmar spilled across the frontier, and Thailand placed ten border provinces on alert and prepared evacuation centres for potential refugees. Talks began between Thailand and Myanmar to address arsenic-tainted rivers, and Mae Sai residents demanded action on cross-border water contamination. The insurgency killed an insurgent trainer and a suspect in Yala operations near Malaysia, and another insurgent was killed in a separate Yala action. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNT2t6UFZhUUZNQm9FMF9ZWVBhRVdHVDFNWVlQSjdoUHp6dGp5WWlWOHRTS2M2aU1MaFZWQVdwaUhaU2lMWUtLbFk4bWwwaXl2dDd0TnJ6UUctWGIwaDJab1l5d29WUnNKWjEyeEZhSVI1UFRoUFYxNVZ3RkdSQzlyV3E1bG1lVEtKbXFxVDBhcjl1VTQwcGFxdDBrTy1UbU5qOUhvQ05oeWQzaV9vUlRuUEhDYVZucW4zbkoyd3hXeUlsdDJJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPSnRlXzdVZzk5ZEVGZUZIVm85VGp0Z2JaV09Oa3BEVktIYjFWbVdXajJRemdqS0dNRjhqRWtjTVlsb1BTVXRHaHpyOW15Q2Vib0pxUUdlQnU5Q3pIY0pJOEx4TW5DSXU4LXYybHliQm9jYWNvLW95alNOSmNmZG1fRmhyQWFUX3BrUW44VUhpc29iazk3a3d6UXNJRF9DS2hfNUkwVWFKYzZLbnlNUXo4dVFmOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sun Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxOeUFjZ1dlQjhDQWFxWlRRdGwwWHRlRXFMaWtyVy1CUTJ1VjdCemZBdDQtZXNXUkxocms4anZEMmFBcWR6MVdMS293MFFweDEzcGRLZkJEMW83VjVXNDkzNjR1Skl1YVd3SV9aY055TEdla2VSVFhWZzl6WW41ZkZrRTNiMTVHeVNmN2h3U1d1THJZRWF4bFpIdFdBX2w4bGxqZ1NPUEdfRExnWWtrd25oRnpVNms3WFkySDdDQjF